WEBVTT

00:15.250 --> 00:16.920
<b>Our Ray of Light</b>

00:38.670 --> 00:40.210
In the spring of my 18th year,

00:40.420 --> 00:43.960
I was considering replaying the first volume
of the game I was obsessed with,

00:41.500 --> 00:42.460
Princess?!

00:44.170 --> 00:49.330
but unbelievably, the millisecond I thought that,
my life ended all too soon.

00:44.170 --> 00:49.330
Princess Pride! Please, wake up! Princess!

00:49.330 --> 00:50.580
Someone, call the doctor!

00:49.920 --> 00:53.250
I remember that previous life now.

00:50.580 --> 00:53.080
Alert Her Highness and the Prince consort as well!

00:54.380 --> 00:57.250
My name is Pride Royal Ivy.

00:57.710 --> 01:01.710
I'm 8 years old, and daughter of
the queen of the Kingdom of Freesia.

01:02.080 --> 01:04.500
In short, I am the first-born princess.

01:05.710 --> 01:09.040
But why, of all people, am I Pride?

01:14.250 --> 01:19.790
I can't believe I've been reincarnated into
the most despicable, fiendish last boss!

01:27.330 --> 01:30.920
<b>"The Selfish Princess Awakens"</b>

01:32.290 --> 01:34.420
This place I've been reincarnated into is an otome game

01:34.420 --> 01:38.540
that I was obsessed with in
my former life: "Our Ray of Light."

01:38.960 --> 01:42.130
Also known as "ORL," I'm in the world
of the first game in the series.

01:44.670 --> 01:50.000
This me, Pride, reigned as the last boss
who has committed a number of atrocities,

01:50.250 --> 01:53.460
and in ten years time, she causes
the downfall of this country.

01:54.040 --> 01:58.790
In the process, she causes
the love interests to be scarred for life.

02:03.750 --> 02:09.420
In the end, she pays for her sins against the main
character and the men with her own life.

02:14.830 --> 02:15.710
Pride!

02:17.500 --> 02:18.540
Father...

02:20.250 --> 02:24.420
This person is my father, who I am the pride and joy of,
the Prince consort of the kingdom.

02:25.380 --> 02:29.880
Are you all right? The doctor did say
that your life is not in danger, but...

02:30.540 --> 02:33.080
Rosa was also very concerned about you.

02:34.040 --> 02:35.710
Rosa Royal Ivy.

02:36.000 --> 02:39.630
My mother, the most powerful leader in this country.

02:40.380 --> 02:43.040
I hardly ever meet with my mother.

02:43.460 --> 02:48.500
I've heard she's occupied with her duties as queen,
but the true reason is...

02:50.080 --> 02:51.040
Father.

02:51.040 --> 02:51.750
Hm?

02:52.500 --> 02:55.080
I... have a younger sister, don't I?

02:57.210 --> 03:01.420
Right. If this is the game's world, she already exists.

03:01.960 --> 03:06.460
My sister, who is two years younger,
the second-born princess of this country,

03:06.460 --> 03:10.880
and the protagonist of this world, Tiara Royal Ivy, is...

03:11.920 --> 03:15.500
Why do you ask such a... I understand!

03:15.830 --> 03:17.830
You already possess the same
power of precognition as Rosa!

03:19.040 --> 03:21.330
Ah, congratulations to you, Pride!

03:21.710 --> 03:25.130
You are our nation's genuine crown princess!

03:25.210 --> 03:31.960
What? This situation, this is not how the childhood
memory scene that I saw in the game went!

03:33.250 --> 03:39.420
For now, just rest. We'll talk in detail later.
That includes your younger sister Tiara, as well.

03:47.710 --> 03:51.790
The Kingdom of Freesia,
the setting of the otome game "ORL"

03:51.790 --> 03:55.460
is a mysterious country where it's possible
for people with special abilities to be born.

03:55.920 --> 04:01.040
Among the most valuable was the "precognition,"
regarded as divine revelations of the next monarch.

04:01.630 --> 04:05.790
A great deal of the precognition holders
are people next in line for the throne,

04:06.040 --> 04:08.170
and women are especially granted the ability.

04:08.460 --> 04:15.040
In the Kingdom of Freesia, it is customary for the next
person to gain this ability to succeed to the throne.

04:15.750 --> 04:20.540
Even in the game, there was a scene where 8-year old
Pride correctly guessed the existence of her little sister.

04:20.960 --> 04:27.040
That specifically is the moment where Pride obtains
precognition, therefore succession to the throne,

04:27.580 --> 04:30.750
and thus began the tragedy of this country.

04:31.380 --> 04:32.080
But...

04:32.500 --> 04:34.380
That's not the situation right now!

04:35.880 --> 04:39.290
Right, I am an atrocious, self-centered princess.

04:39.710 --> 04:43.710
I am the last boss of this world,
who at the end of the route is convicted and dies.

04:44.130 --> 04:49.330
In the single bad end route,
either Tiara or the love interest dies.

04:49.790 --> 04:50.960
Nevertheless,

04:50.960 --> 04:55.170
I can't imagine going forward with the bad end while
making use of memories of the previous life I had.

04:55.920 --> 05:02.080
After all, Tiara and the love interest are good people who
will do their best for their people, and for the country.

05:02.500 --> 05:07.790
On the other hand, Pride never once considers
using her precognition to be helpful.

05:09.210 --> 05:14.290
As for the prediction this time, there was something
more important than having a younger sister... Ah!

05:16.130 --> 05:17.330
Where's my father?!

05:17.750 --> 05:22.000
The prince consort headed to report the news
to Her Royal Highness a short while ago.

05:27.250 --> 05:29.250
Father!

05:31.580 --> 05:33.830
No, I'm not seeing you off!

05:35.080 --> 05:36.710
Princess! Please stop!

05:36.710 --> 05:39.210
Stay back! I will not tolerate you stopping me!

05:46.830 --> 05:49.500
Father! You mustn't ride the carriage!

05:49.790 --> 05:55.630
That carriage has a broken wheel!
You'll get into an accident before you meet with Mother!

06:10.710 --> 06:12.330
Check the wheel immediately!

06:13.670 --> 06:14.830
Thank goodness...

06:15.630 --> 06:20.330
In the game, Pride couldn't predict
her father's accident that would happen soon after.

06:20.750 --> 06:24.000
But since I knew the game in my previous life...

06:24.000 --> 06:25.750
I deeply apologize, Princess!

06:31.580 --> 06:36.880
Please forgive her insolence.
This girl has nowhere else to go!

06:37.210 --> 06:39.000
I beg you, please forgive her!

06:42.210 --> 06:44.500
I can't believe I cause them this much terror.

06:45.330 --> 06:49.290
That's right. So far I have acted as selfishly as I pleased.

06:49.830 --> 06:55.040
We had done away with many a maid,
with calls for punishment and the death penalty.

06:56.000 --> 06:59.920
No, this is not as simple as just selfishness...

07:01.040 --> 07:02.290
I'm sorry...

07:04.750 --> 07:07.380
I'm sorry!

07:14.000 --> 07:14.670
Pride!

07:21.790 --> 07:24.080
Why are you crying? Are you injured?

07:24.290 --> 07:26.290
Or have these people done something to you?

07:26.750 --> 07:27.830
No!

07:28.130 --> 07:30.290
I am the one at fault, Father!

07:30.790 --> 07:33.330
If you must punish someone, let it be me...

07:34.460 --> 07:38.920
I understand very well since I have memories from
my previous life where I had lived to 18 years old.

07:39.420 --> 07:44.210
The terror of having the power, and the suffering
of the people that would bend to my every whim...

07:44.830 --> 07:50.130
I have only a mere 10 years of life left,
and I will do my best to remember only this.

07:50.750 --> 07:54.710
Because I am the first-born princess of this country.

08:02.130 --> 08:07.630
In one month, on Tiara's 6th birthday,
the two of you will finally be allowed to meet.

08:08.330 --> 08:09.960
Things will become busy after that.

08:10.460 --> 08:14.000
As you are officially the next in line for the throne,
there are a plethora of things to be learned.

08:15.250 --> 08:21.040
Ah yes, I must also rush to find a younger brother to act
as an assistant and invite him as an adopted child...

08:19.920 --> 08:20.790
Huh?

08:21.040 --> 08:23.830
Did he just say... younger brother?

08:30.170 --> 08:31.540
You sound so foolish!

08:32.000 --> 08:39.460
You won't get away with this!
Never, ever, ever! I'm going to kill you no matter what!

08:39.460 --> 08:41.130
You're going to kill me?

08:41.540 --> 08:43.830
You couldn't possibly do such a thing.

08:44.130 --> 08:46.380
After all, you just now...

08:57.460 --> 09:01.420
I feel like I've been having bad dreams night after night.

09:01.420 --> 09:04.630
I'm finished, Princess Pride. Princess Pride?

09:05.290 --> 09:06.170
Yes?

09:08.540 --> 09:09.670
I'm finished.

09:10.380 --> 09:11.960
Thank you, Lotte.

09:14.960 --> 09:16.420
Please come this way.

09:20.830 --> 09:22.540
I'll be back soon, Jacques.

09:23.580 --> 09:24.420
Yes, princess!

09:30.880 --> 09:33.540
That selfish princess has been reformed, you say?

09:33.540 --> 09:37.960
Yes, it is as if a goddess had come down from
the heavens and resides within the princess.

09:37.960 --> 09:41.880
Did she become someone worthy of the crown
when she obtained her precognition?

09:42.210 --> 09:43.880
I want to deny everything...

09:44.080 --> 09:49.170
I'm just me, with the memories of
my previous life. Nothing has changed.

09:49.500 --> 09:56.960
The Pride in the game generally became even
more atrocious due to gaining her precognition... What?

09:57.130 --> 10:02.460
Wait... In the game, after Father's accidental death,
Mother should have passed away as well.

10:02.460 --> 10:05.130
But now, they're both alive and well.

10:05.540 --> 10:09.040
Could it be that I can change the story in this world?!

10:14.290 --> 10:18.710
Your brother-in-law is just over here,
Your Highness. Please, enter.

10:32.460 --> 10:35.210
There you are, Pride. I'll introduce you.

10:35.380 --> 10:40.380
Starting today, this child
is your younger brother-in-law, Stale.

10:45.170 --> 10:47.000
Stale Royal Ivy.

10:47.710 --> 10:50.210
A commoner and only child of his mother.

10:50.670 --> 10:53.710
In "ORL" he's one of the love interests.

10:54.380 --> 10:56.920
He's 7 years old, one year younger than you.

10:57.500 --> 11:01.210
From here forward, he will act as an assistant to you,
the next in line for the throne.

11:01.500 --> 11:03.420
In the future, he will become the Prince Regent.

11:03.830 --> 11:07.460
He possesses the extremely exceptional
special ability called teleportation.

11:07.790 --> 11:09.250
You two will become good friends.

11:10.000 --> 11:12.250
Ah, wondering about these handcuffs, yes?

11:12.750 --> 11:14.290
It is pathetic,

11:14.290 --> 11:18.210
he tried multiple times to run away before he made it
here, and he did a number of other things as well.

11:18.710 --> 11:20.880
He's settled down for now,

11:20.880 --> 11:25.710
but to prevent him from disappearing again,
his abilities are being suppressed by the handcuffs.

11:26.000 --> 11:30.670
Treating him like this when he's just been torn away
from his mother, by decree of the royal family...

11:41.500 --> 11:46.630
Pride Royal Ivy. I'm pleased to meet you, Stale.

11:47.250 --> 11:51.630
Since we are to become family,
I do look forward to making your acquaintance.

11:55.670 --> 11:56.460
Okay.

11:58.290 --> 12:01.250
Huh? I feel like I've seen this somewhere before....

12:02.130 --> 12:05.960
Tomorrow, he will enter a
"Contract of Subordination" with you.

12:06.210 --> 12:09.380
These handcuffs will soon be unnecessary.

12:10.580 --> 12:13.000
This is the "Contract of Subordination."

12:14.290 --> 12:18.670
When you sign this,
I'll allow you to see your mother again.

12:34.710 --> 12:36.670
Just as I'd expect from a commoner child!

12:36.830 --> 12:39.540
Pitiful that you can't read nor
write anything besides your name.

12:39.790 --> 12:45.330
The contract you just signed isn't a "Contract of
Subordination," it's a "Contract of Fealty."

12:45.920 --> 12:49.500
That means you absolutely cannot disobey
any of the master's orders.

12:54.880 --> 13:02.920
Stale, as my slave from here on,
I look forward to our future together.

13:07.330 --> 13:11.540
That's right. In the game, I deceived Stale...

13:12.380 --> 13:15.080
This follows the game's storyline.

13:15.630 --> 13:21.670
Looks like this is destiny that the story can't change.
However, if that's the case...

13:22.500 --> 13:24.130
You must be tired from today.

13:24.130 --> 13:27.250
Please get some good rest in your room,
in preparation for tomorrow.

13:31.420 --> 13:35.380
I'm sure I'll have a chance to talk to Stale tonight.

13:41.040 --> 13:44.040
Princess Pride... Do you need something?

13:45.210 --> 13:47.040
Sorry for coming to you in the middle of the night.

13:49.750 --> 13:53.790
But there's something I simply must talk with you
about before tomorrow's contract signing.

13:57.960 --> 14:01.000
Well, Stale, do you want to see your mother?

14:14.500 --> 14:15.500
What's that?

14:15.500 --> 14:17.130
The keys to your handcuffs.

14:18.040 --> 14:21.040
I secretly took it from my father's bureau.

14:21.580 --> 14:25.040
With this, you can use your special ability and escape.

14:27.170 --> 14:28.790
Now, hold out your hands.

14:28.790 --> 14:29.670
No.

14:30.040 --> 14:31.130
Why not?

14:31.830 --> 14:36.830
If I escape from the castle, I heard that my mom and I
would receive a horrible punishment.

14:37.380 --> 14:40.500
I don't want my mom to be punished.

14:40.500 --> 14:43.830
Right, that's why game Pride signed a contract with Stale,

14:43.830 --> 14:49.420
and tricked him into thinking he had
official permission to visit his mother.

14:50.420 --> 14:54.750
After the official notice, the prince consort
gave me two weeks' time,

14:54.750 --> 14:57.880
and I was able to have a lot of talks with my mom.

14:58.630 --> 15:04.170
Even though I was crying so much, on the day
we parted I was able to give her a proper goodbye...

15:04.380 --> 15:07.210
And she told me... that she loved me so very much.

15:09.290 --> 15:13.290
Besides, if I run away, they'll call for another kid next.

15:13.920 --> 15:19.630
I've got friends that have special abilities...
And I don't want any of them to be sent for in my place.

15:20.420 --> 15:21.830
So I can't run away.

15:22.500 --> 15:27.710
As ordered, I'll forget my mother and
do everything I can for you here, Princess Pride.

15:28.630 --> 15:30.920
How shallow I am.

15:31.460 --> 15:34.250
Telling a child of only 7 to run away so thoughtlessly,

15:34.250 --> 15:38.000
when I don't even know just how much
he's prepared himself to come here.

15:38.790 --> 15:42.210
Such... such a kind child, and I...

15:56.210 --> 15:59.670
I appreciate your concern over someone like me.

16:00.380 --> 16:02.670
You can take the key back to where it was found.

16:03.170 --> 16:04.420
Tomorrow, I'll-

16:03.540 --> 16:04.670
I'm sorry.

16:16.920 --> 16:20.630
I'm so sorry I intruded on you at such a late hour.

16:22.960 --> 16:25.880
Good night. Sleep well.

16:37.710 --> 16:40.130
The contract is now executed.

16:44.250 --> 16:47.500
I look forward to your future as part of our family, my son.

16:49.830 --> 16:50.960
Princess Pride!

16:53.750 --> 16:56.540
I'm looking forward to being by your side.

16:56.540 --> 17:00.710
I swear I will always protect you,
Princess Pride, and your sister too.

17:01.170 --> 17:03.040
Thank you, Stale.

17:03.630 --> 17:09.250
But just call me "Pride" from now on.
We're family, after all.

17:09.500 --> 17:11.250
Oh, well...

17:11.460 --> 17:13.710
Your Royal Highness, Princess Pride.

17:17.380 --> 17:23.710
This person acts as the assistant to my father.
I believe he has the special ability of eternal youth.

17:24.170 --> 17:27.330
I can't quite recall how he was in the game, though.

17:29.080 --> 17:34.080
While the young Prince Regent Vest can
call the Princess by her first name,

17:34.210 --> 17:38.540
in front of others you will address her
as "Her Royal Highness" or "Elder Sister."

17:39.210 --> 17:43.250
Then when we're with others you can call me
"Elder Sister" but when it's just the two of us,

17:43.250 --> 17:45.630
please call me "Pride." Okay?

17:50.460 --> 17:55.710
It seems that Princess Pride has
become a rather fine vessel for a queen.

17:56.460 --> 17:59.880
Just as expected from someone who
acquired precognition at such a tender age.

18:00.170 --> 18:04.000
When I first heard it had awakened,
I wondered what could happen...

18:04.380 --> 18:07.500
Chancellor Gilbert, do you mean
that to be a compliment?

18:08.920 --> 18:14.460
Please excuse me. However, it is quite the shame
that Her Royal Highness could not be in attendance.

18:14.830 --> 18:15.750
Princess Tiara al-

18:26.830 --> 18:30.750
This is the library. Feel free to use it whenever you wish.

18:31.250 --> 18:34.380
Okay, thank you, Your Highness-

18:35.170 --> 18:36.920
Pr-Princess Pride...

18:37.330 --> 18:39.830
Just Pride is fine. I told you, didn't I?

18:42.250 --> 18:44.790
Well, goodnight, Stale.

18:45.330 --> 18:47.000
Goodnight, Pri...

18:50.130 --> 18:52.540
P-R-I-D-E.

18:53.500 --> 18:54.920
Stale.

18:58.170 --> 18:58.960
Pride!

19:04.960 --> 19:06.460
Adorable!

19:09.580 --> 19:10.630
Stale?!

19:23.830 --> 19:25.960
I can't believe he caught a cold...

19:26.630 --> 19:28.500
And we were together the whole time.

19:31.670 --> 19:32.960
Mom...

19:35.000 --> 19:36.880
He's endured everything this whole time...

19:37.750 --> 19:42.330
He's worked hard studying the way of life
in the castle and studying until he got a fever...

19:43.540 --> 19:45.080
And still, I...

19:45.750 --> 19:49.880
I've been the most horrible Pride,
to a child that's still only 7 years old!

19:50.710 --> 19:52.960
Stale, this is an order.

19:59.960 --> 20:02.880
I made him kill his own mother.

20:19.250 --> 20:21.420
Sorry... I'm sorry...

20:21.630 --> 20:23.000
For what?

20:30.580 --> 20:36.670
I'm sorry, I... couldn't even help you,
I couldn't help a single person.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.880
I don't want you to forgive me.

20:41.130 --> 20:46.880
It's just, you and your mother are separated,
and I can't help you two...

20:47.380 --> 20:50.920
I'm sorry I can't fill your heart.

20:54.880 --> 21:00.330
I promise you, I will never,
ever hurt you more than I already have.

21:00.750 --> 21:04.420
You, and the country your mother is in,

21:04.830 --> 21:07.080
I will make it so that everyone can keep smiling,

21:07.540 --> 21:09.540
for as long as I am alive!

21:18.580 --> 21:23.500
So, if I do become the most deplorable queen...

21:27.380 --> 21:29.130
kill me, okay?

23:18.380 --> 23:24.040
Pride... I will protect you.

23:28.130 --> 23:33.750
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:34.500 --> 23:38.500
Episode 2: "The Villainous Princess
Makes a Request of Her Brother."

23:35.250 --> 23:40.880
<b>"The Villainous Princess Makes a Request of Her Brother"</b>
